<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>HTML Text Formatting</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>HTML Formatting Activity</h2>
    
    <p><b>This text is bold.</b></p>
    <p><strong>This text is important (strong).</strong></p>
    
    <p><i>This text is italic.</i></p>
    <p><em>This text is emphasized.</em></p>
    
    <p><u>This text is underlined.</u></p>
    
    <p><mark>This text is highlighted (marked).</mark></p>
    
    <p>This is some <del>deleted text</del> and some <ins>inserted text</ins>.</p>
    
    <p>This is a <sub>subscript</sub> and this is a <sup>superscript</sup>.</p>

</body>
</html>
